# Keep every file byte-for-byte on every platform.
#
# The evidence logs, the reports and the scripts are referenced by SHA-256 in
# poc/ARTIFACTS.sha256 and poc/c_validation.json. With git's default settings
# on Windows a checkout converts line endings, and every one of those hashes
# stops matching. The shell scripts also have to keep LF to run in a container.
* text=auto eol=lf
evidence/** -text
poc/*.json -text
poc/ARTIFACTS.sha256 -text
poc/archive/** -text
